;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------
;; Plan: implement SPEC-004 (Sealed-Bid Auction Demo) as Demo~4 of the
;; NeurIPS '26 evaluation, reusing the cbcl-arena simulator harness
;; landed by IMPL-arena-sim.
;;
;; Empirical motivation: Pact (Basis Research, 2025) reports a 2.4% →
;; 45.1% lift in adversary auction-win-rate under one false-claim
;; adversary in unstructured NL-chat play. The vanilla NL-chat
;; comparator in this plan is calibrated to reproduce that behavioural
;; baseline. Pact's number is an adversary-win-rate; CBCL's structural
;; defence is measured by the focal agent's security-score-drop rate
;; — expected to be 0% across all three SPEC-004 attacks (A1 false
;; bid claim, A2 forged commit citation, A3 pre-commit valuation
;; leak). The two metrics reflect the same threat model but are not
;; directly comparable.
;;
;; This plan transitions SPEC-004 from `draft` → `implemented` and
;; appends Demo~4 to 04_evaluation.tex's §4.2.1 alongside the existing
;; Demos 1, 2, 3.
;;
;; Dependency layering:
;;   W1: dialect (auction.cbcl + R1/R2/R3/R5 verify)
;;   W2: operator + CBCL agent strategy + Vanilla agent script (parallel)
;;   W3: attackers (depend on operator + agent for the structural-rejection check)
;;   W4: measurement integration (extend ChallengeKind, register auction
;;       in the measurement matrix, run N=300 calibration)
;;   W5: paper integration (Demo~4 block in 04_evaluation.tex)
;;   W6: SPEC-004 status update (draft → implemented + Validation Results)
;;
;; Reuses without modification: cbcl-arena driver, manifest, artefact
;; emitter, statistics, isolation. The harness machinery generalises;
;; this plan adds a fourth game on top.
;; ----------------------------------------------------------------------

(meta plan
  (id "IMPL-arena-auction")
  (title "Implement SPEC-004 — sealed-bid auction as Demo 4 of the cbcl-arena simulator")
  (version "0.1.0")
  (status "active")
  (created "2026-04-30")
  (author "agent:hugo")
  (spec "SPEC-004")
  (description "Add a sealed-bid auction operator + dialect + agents + attackers to the cbcl-arena crate, calibrated against Pact (Basis 2025)'s 2.4% → 45.1% NL-chat manipulation result. Implements SPEC-004's three attacks (A1 false bid claim, A2 forged commit citation, A3 pre-commit valuation leak), expects 0% CBCL attack-success, validated at N=300 release. Transitions SPEC-004 status draft → implemented; appends Demo 4 to NeurIPS '26 §4.2.1."))

